1 NAME Bengt Bengtsson /Mahlberg/
2 GIVN Bengt Bengtsson
2 SURN Mahlberg
2 _MARNM Mahlberg
2 NICK Marberg
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1648
