2 CONC  kappalainen '''Pehr Salmenius''' 2123 (yo 1671) ja '''Brita Argillander'''.  Ylioppilas Turussa 3.10.1703 [Salmenius] Joh. Vib _ 250. Nimi on kopioitu Albumista v. 1786 Viipurilaisen osakunnan matrikkeliin 1703. d. 3. Octbr. Joha
2 CONC nnes Salmenius. Vihitty papiksi Viipurin hiippakunnassa 1708.   — Apulaispappi Kerimäellä 1708, vt. kappalainen (Venäjälle viedyn isänsä sijainen) siellä tuomiokapitulin luvalla 1712, vakinainen 1722, sai vanhuuden takia viransija
2 CONC isen 1763. Varapastori 1755.  † Kerimäellä 6.7.1764. - Pso: Kristina Elisabet Hammar († 1757).
2 CONT ** Poika: Impilahden kirkkoherra '''Johan Salmenius''' 5633 (yo 1728, † 1764)
2 CONT
2 CONT * Johan was student in Åbo Academy, Viborg student society 3 Oct 1703. He was ordained in Viborg's diocese 1708. He was nominated for curate in Kerimäki 1708. He was nominated for acting chaplain (locum for his to Russia removed f
2 CONC ather) in Kerimäki 1712. He got interim power 7 Jul 1715. He got confirmation 14 Sep 1722. He was earlier priest in Systerbäck. He was chaplain in Nykyrka 1729. He was ordained in Viborg 9 Sep 1730. He was nominated for pastor in 
2 CONC Kivinebb 1742. He was nominated for vice vicar 1755. He got because of old age a locum 1763. He was owner of a smal farm, Kluostarila in Kerimäki.
