1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Student in Åbo Akademi (Vib., not introduced in list of members) 1759, mentioned to student still 30 Oct 1760; was later stated as student in Göttingen (according to certain sources already 1758); teacher in S:t Pe
2 CONC tersburg at German Petri-Schule 1769; subkonrektor of Viborgs katedralskola 1767; konrektor 1769; ordained in Viborg 1770 and nominated as chaplain in Sordavala; vice pastor 1772; vicar in Jakimvaara 1787; was in autumn 1796 appoi
2 CONC nted rural dean of Northkarelia northern denomination by the civil tribunal in Viborg at the instance of the consistory in Viborg; according to Akiander was Karl Johan Melart "en ganska lärd man, dålig hushållare, men flitig med s
2 CONC ina böckers läsning".
2 CONT
2 CONT kl. 1759 Karl Johan Melartopaeus, myöhemmin Melart 8133. * Sortavalassa 30.10.1739. Vht: Sortavalan ent. kappalainen Karl Gustaf Melartopaeus 5830 (yo 1731, † 1752) ja Regina Sacklenius. Ylioppilas Turussa kl. 1759 [Melartopæus] C
2 CONC ar. Johannes Vib _ 463. Ylioppilas Göttingenissä 9.7.1764 Carl Joh. Melart, Petropolitanus, theol., ex ac. Aboa. Vihitty papiksi Viipurin hiippakunnassa 1770. — Pietarin saks. koulun (Petri-Schule) opettaja 1763. Viipurin katedraa
2 CONC likoulun alikonrehtori 1767, konrehtori 1769. Sortavalan kappalainen 1770. Varapastori 1772. Jaakkiman kirkkoherra 1787. Lääninrovasti 1796. † Jaakkimassa 26.1.1804.
2 CONT
