1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Had two children with her husband Henrik (born as Heikki Uppa): Katarina (1700) and Kristina (1702) before she died in September 1703, only 20 years old.
2 CONT
2 CONT Henrik, now a widower, married partner #2 Margareta Polviander/Uppa, sometime between 1704 and 1706. Got a son with her, Henrik Wegelius (1707). So the younger Henrik was the half-brother of Katarina and Kristina.
