2 CONT * IIIoo 1792 with Christina Ulrica von Bruce (1761-1824)
2 CONT * † 1799-09-06 Wargsäter (Vargsäter), [http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skeda_f%C3%B6rsamling Skeda], [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diocese_of_Link%C3%B6ping Linköping], [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%96sterg%C3%B6tland_County Öste
